{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/528957-who-does-the-scale-blood-cleansing-ritual-work-on","id":528957,"title":"Who does the Scale Blood Cleansing Ritual work on?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-26T10:51:14-07:00","id":528957,"title":"Who does the Scale Blood Cleansing Ritual work on?","content":"It doesn't say anything about only mortals, but the line about washing a person in this vitae mixture (in a process similar to waterboarding) being &quot;tantamount to torture&quot;, it makes me think it is intended for mortals/people who need to breath? I'd think for vampires it'd merely be a bit unpleasant and ick-tasting.<br /> <br /> Can it be used on Kindred, and if so is it still like torture? Should the Kindred have to roll to resist frenzy?<br /> <br /> Secondly...can you use this scale on yourself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2007-wade-l","name":"Wade L","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2007_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"136"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T11:04:25-07:00","id":528983,"title":"","content":"It's likely intended to be used on mortals since they are more common targets for blood bonds.<br /> <br /> If used on a Kindred it's probably still isn't fun due to the mystical elements involved. It tears away blood bonds, which are inherantly powerful and emotional. It's probably more psychological with Kindred than physical but still sucks.<br /> <br /> I see no reason why you couldn't use it on yourself but I bet it'd be harder; you'd probably need an assistant at the very least or a hell of a Resolve+Composure roll to stay calm during the process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":785,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/785-full-time-gm","user":"Full Time GM","date":". 05-26-2015, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/785-full-time-gm","name":"Full Time GM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar785_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T11:17:13-07:00","id":529019,"title":"","content":"&quot;You know, one of the things I hate about doing this on myself is how I have to hang upside-down like a bat to do it. It just looks so clich\u00e9d. Alright, hand me the bucket.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T11:28:57-07:00","id":529047,"title":"","content":"I feel like nothing good ever follows the statement: &quot;Alright, hand me the bucket&quot;.<br /> <br /> There are probably variations on the ritual used by different Kindred or septs to add that ritual flare. Inverted crucifixion comes to mind; probably with ropes, not spikes, unless it's also being done by someone who follows the practices of the Impaled.<br /> <br /> With a little more thought it occurs to me: say you do this ritual with your own blood, would it actually work? I was focused on the physical side of things but could you mystically severe a tie in a closed loop? The blood you put in is your own and so carries the bond. It's like trying to clean a floor with same dirty mop water.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/785-full-time-gm","name":"Full Time GM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar785_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T14:01:11-07:00","id":529252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Full Time GM</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/528957-who-does-the-scale-blood-cleansing-ritual-work-on?p=528983#post528983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see no reason why you couldn't use it on yourself but I bet it'd be harder; you'd probably need an assistant at the very least or a hell of a Resolve+Composure roll to stay calm during the process.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine a frenzy check would be pretty likely...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2007-wade-l","name":"Wade L","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2007_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"136"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T14:17:48-07:00","id":529260,"title":"","content":"Don't forget the breaking point from the vincullum for doing this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}